{"id":"input-e2bdf2da7b01","steamAppId":"933820","name":"Endzone - A World Apart","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/933820/","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":6.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"6 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-e2bdf2da7b01","canonicalId":"steam-app-933820","suppliedName":"Endzone - A World Apart","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Endzone - A World Apart","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2021,"developers":["Gentlymad Studios"],"publishers":["Assemble Entertainment","WhisperGames"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"shortDescription":"Endzone is a post-apocalyptic survival city builder, where you start a new civilization with a group of people after an ecological disaster. Build them a new home and ensure their survival in a shattered world, threatened by constant radiation, toxic rain, sandstorms and droughts.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"933820"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/933820/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:14.226Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:14.226Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"933820","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/933820/","officialWebsite":"https://gentlymad.org/","support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":6,"unit":"GB","display":"6 GB","approximateBytes":6000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 6 GB"},"recommended":null},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"unknown","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":13,"description":"Captions available"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"933820","steamName":"Endzone - A World Apart","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/933820/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:54:29.212758+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Endzone is a post-apocalyptic survival city builder, where you start a new civilization with a group of people after an ecological disaster. Build them a new home and ensure their survival in a shattered world, threatened by constant radiation, toxic rain, sandstorms and droughts.","detailedDescription":"About Endzone - A World Apart\n\nIn 2021, a global ecological disaster plunged the world into chaos and brought humanity to the verge of extinction. Only few were able to escape into underground facilities called \"Endzones\". 150 years later, mankind returns to the surface - under your command! In an extremely hostile environment full of radioactivity, contaminated rain and extreme climate change, you'll have to prove your worth as a leader. \n\n• \nBuild a settlement on the hostile surface of the earth with over 70 different buildings and take care of your men, women and children. \n\n• \nGather & refine many different resources and manage your economy by building an efficient infrastructure with streets and depositories. \n\n• \nExperience dynamically simulated, believable environments! Every ground cell in the game has its own humidity and radiation values. \n\n• \nSurvive in a world of constant threats including radioactively contaminated ground, droughts, toxic rain, sandstorms, and raiders. \n\n• \nSend expeditions to forgotten places and make meaningful decisions that change the fate of your people. \n\n• \nExperience a living settlement and fulfill side missions to cater for your settlers needs. \n\n• \nA variety of challenging scenarios with specific winning conditions and a distinct storyline will put your survival skills to the test. \n\nThe world as we know it is gone. Build a new home for the last human survivors on earth! Give them shelter and a house. Fulfill their basic needs with steady water and food supplies, educate them, ensure their survival and help them stay motivated with over 50 different buildings. \n\nAs the leader of your settlement, coordinate and assign different professions and tasks. Let your people gather & refine many different resources and manage your economy by building an efficient infrastructure with streets, depositories and markets.\n\n \n\nEvery ground cell in the game features dynamically simulated humidity and radiation. Watch as rain clouds irrigate your soil or prepare for constant fights against contaminated rain bringing devastating radiation to your lands.  \n\nThe climate has changed! Prepare for recurring and agonizing droughts and plan ahead by stocking up food and water. Every cycle is a new challenge! Withstand the unstoppable sandstorm, as it destroys buildings and brings deadly radiation. \n\nThe invisible danger of radiation is still haunting the surface with contaminated rain. Protect your people from radiation sickness with special gear. Clean water with active coal filters, build roofs on your fields and dig up the ground as a last resort to remove radiation from your land.\n\n \n\nThe world is in shambles but some of the manmade fragments still remain. Send expeditions to ruins and long forgotten places and make meaningful decisions that change the fate of your people.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/header.jpg?t=1783351893"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783351893"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/extras/2e03189624a4e742540fa7af1acda79f.avif?t=1783351893","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/ss_04932227976f235dccd25a6754c0c9ae6d0c8558.600x338.jpg?t=1783351893","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933820/ss_04932227976f235dccd25a6754c0c9ae6d0c8558.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783351893"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.st